  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nyarunazi Coffee Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to increase availability of coffee collection centers; access to an environmentally sound washing station as well as create a revolving fund for farmers to receive direct payment for their cherries. Funds will be used for training in improved agricultural techniques; hiring staff; cherry sorting and drying beds; collection centers; a truck and motorcycle; and to develop a marketing strategy.</narrative>
  </description>
